\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \cb2 \strokec3 7.\'a0Can we use Selenium for Product Development? If not, What is selenium used for?\'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs36 \cf4 \strokec4 Selenium is Not a Product Development Framework, Selenium is Automation Testing Framework. Selenium can be used for testing Web Applications.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec3 8.\'a0What is Selenium IDE? when should we use it?\'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs36 \cf4 \strokec4 The Selenium-IDE (Integrated Development Environment) is the tool, used to develop your Selenium test cases. Selenium IDE is useful for beginners, where they want to write less code and actions can be done using User Interface (UI).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec3 9.\'a0How to install Selenium IDE?\'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs36 \cf4 \strokec4 Selenium IDE is supported as a browser Plugin or Add On. Installation is simple Just like installing any other Plugins. Selenium IDE is supported officially in Chrome and Firefox. However, Edge also has the Selenium IDE plugin.\
For Example, If we need to install Selenium IDE as \'a0Plugin to Chrome we need to go to Chrome Webstore and search for Selenium IDE and click on Install to install the Selenium Chrome IDE. Similarly for other browsers.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec3 10.\'a0What is Selenese?\'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs36 \cf4 \strokec4 Selenium is the Web Automation Tool, which provides a set of Selenium commands to test the web applications. These Selenium Commands are often referred to as Selenese.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

