\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \cb2 \strokec3 13.\'a0How to find Single and Multiple Elements in Selenium?\'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs36 \cf4 \strokec4 Single Element can be found by using the FindElement command\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \uc0\u8232 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 Example:\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \uc0\u8232 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 WebElement academy = driver.findElement(By.id("rahulshettyacademy"));\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 Multiple Elements can be find using FindElements Command\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \uc0\u8232 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 Example:\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \uc0\u8232 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 List<WebElement> books= driver.findElements(By.cssSelector("#books li"));\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec3 14.\'a0What is By in selenium?\'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs36 \cf4 \strokec4 By is the class in Selenium, it provides the locater specific methods and can be used with driver.findElement(s) to get the Element.\
List of Important Methods provided by By Class\
Id()\
linkText()\
partialLinkText()\
name()\
tagName()\
xpath()\
className()\
cssSelector()\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec3 15.\'a0Explain at least 5 different types of exceptions in Selenium.\'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 NoSuchElementException
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 \
Reason: The exception occurs when WebDriver is unable to find and locate elements. The incorrect locator can cause this exception in selenium.\

\f0\b \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 TimeoutException
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 \
Reason: Selenium waits until a specific time period, If the element could not display or load in specified time.\

\f0\b \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 WebDriverException
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 :\
Reason: Webdriver performs actions immediately after \'91closing\'92 the browser or it can also occur when our code unable to initialize the webdriver\

\f0\b \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 ElementNotVisibleException
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 \
Reason: Selenium tries to perform action on invisible Elements\

\f0\b \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 NoSuchSessionException
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 \
Reason: When webdriver cannot execute the commands using driver instance.\

\f0\b \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 NoAlertPresentException
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 \
Reason: The user is trying to handle an alert that is not present.\

\f0\b \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 NoSuchWindowException
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 \
Reason: WebDriver tries to switch to an invalid window.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

