\f0\b \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 .\'a0
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 In-Page Object Model, Each web page of an application as a class file. Each class file will contain only corresponding web page elements\

\f0\b \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 Data-Driven Framework:\'a0
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 When the entire test data is generated from some external files like Excel, CSV, XML, or some database table, then it is called Data Driven framework\

\f0\b \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 Keyword Driven Framework:\'a0
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 When only the instructions and operations are written in a different file like an Excel worksheet, it is called Keyword Driven framework.\

\f0\b \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 Hybrid Framework:\'a0
