\cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 Below is a simple example to capture network requests.\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 DevTools devTool = driver.getDevTools();\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
